# Relay space metadata (should never be committed)
# Use glob + negation rather than the bare `.relay/` directory pattern —
# a directory-level ignore shadows any child negations, so `git add` would
# refuse the tracked files below even though they're whitelisted.
.relay/*
!.relay/tasks/
!.relay/task-discussion/
!.relay/instructions.md
!.relay/provider-strategy.md
!.relay/provider-watch-prompt.md
!.relay/provider-watch-review-prompt.md
!.relay/provider-watch-implement-prompt.md
!.relay/changelog-watch-state.json

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
